## Waves that slide in from the left, using the scroll command. Self-contained.
##
## direction=right makes content enter from the left; blanking=true adds a blank
## lead-in (empty screen) so the waves slide in, and the linear pass ends on
## blanks too, so loop|forever wraps cleanly (empty -> empty).

title|Waves slidein
scale|0.12
loop|forever

sprite|b0|0x0000
sprite|b1|0x0008
sprite|b2|0x0808
sprite|b3|0x0888
sprite|b4|0x0889

segment|crest_1|{b1}
segment|crest_2|{b1}{b2}{b1}
segment|crest_3|{b1}{b2}{b3}{b2}{b1}
segment|crest_4|{b1}{b2}{b3}{b4}{b3}{b2}{b1}

## 46-tube wave (peaks 1,3,2,4,2,1,4,2,1); the blank lead-in/out comes from blanking.
segment|wave_profile|{b0}{crest_1}{b0}{crest_3}{b0}{b0}{crest_2}{b0}{b0}{crest_4}{b0}{b0}{crest_2}{b0}{b0}{crest_1}{b0}{crest_4}{b0}{crest_2}{b0}{crest_1}{b0}{b0}

scroll|anon|2|wave_profile|direction=right|blanking=true
